  "body": "I was having problems that it's using lots of RAM (12 GB) and CPU, so someone pointed me to https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/1760#issuecomment-379183539. I had some counts that were higher than 100, so I ran that query. Afterwards it stopped using that much RAM, it's only using 1.2 GB now. Synapse is still using 100% CPU, and postgres is only using about 1% CPU now instead of 150%.\r\n\r\nBut at least federation only worked for like the first 10 minutes. I'm now not getting any messages back, I'm not sure my messages make it. I'm the only user, so it's hard to see. I guess I could test on one of the channels that are bridged to IRC.",
